# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: one kind that maps scalars and a list, with a sentinel, `with`, a default and a constant. Public.
format     conformance-held-one
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
kind    k
when    t  k
field   probe.x   x    int
field   probe.s1  s    string
field   probe.z   z    int  absent 255
field   probe.w   w    int  with probe.c1
field   probe.v1  d    int
default probe.v1  5
const   c  7
group   probe.recs  recs
  field  probe.x  x  int
end
field   core.lat  lat  float
